WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:03.350
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.280
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:12.400
I want someone who can support and encourage the others through thick and thin.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.800
Agreed!

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.300
I think she should wear a red ribbon.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.790
Agreed!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.540
Hey, wait! I'm the leader?!

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.210
What's your unit name?

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.710
Powa Powa Puririn!

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.980
The third member who will walk alongside us down this path.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.220
Her name is...

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.720
Toudou Yurika!

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.570
And thus, at Starlight Academy...

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:42.480
Tristar.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.160
Our unit, Soleil.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.610
And don't forget Powa Powa Puririn!

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.290
Three units were formed. {it's just so weird the other way}

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.950
Okay, all finished.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.910
It's so hot! I'm sweating up a storm here.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.540
As a direct descendant of the great 
Count Dracula, I have not the need to sweat.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.180
Here, have some ice-cold tomato juice.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.750
Th-Thank you.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.290
We have a magazine meeting and a recording for a music show after this.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.300
Then there's our live radio broadcast.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.550
I can't not overcome a schedule of this level without a bit of trouble.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.880
How reliable.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.680
Tonight, we'll be returning to the academy for a meeting about our Summer Tour.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.060
Summer Tour?!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:30.540
Yes, we'll be holding a large-scale concert tour this summer.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.320
Yes! This is great!

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.070
The Summer Tour certainly sounds like a lot of fun.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.020
Be sure not to drag me down.

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.110
Okay, okay!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.830
I wonder how Soleil will be spending their summer.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.470
Now then, Soleil is here today to give us a wonderful bit of news.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.670
So...

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.390
Ichigo.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:27.970
Leader.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.230
Oh, right! We will be holding a handshake event today.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.650
Uh, when and where...?

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.540
Um, well...

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.880
We'll be opening at noon.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.130
We'll be waiting at the Diamond Square.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.110
Please come and see us!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.490
Please! {Desu!} {Death!}

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.620
Thank you for coming, Soleil.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.890
I wonder if they'll be okay with Onee-chan as the leader.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.700
Thank you for your continued patronage.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:56.000
And thank you for always making such wonderful lunches.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.330
They're so cute.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.410
This is a poster of my older sister.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.890
Wow, really?

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.600
This is Aoi-neesan, and she's Ran-san.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.990
Haven't you heard about Soleil, the idol unit?

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.760
Their debut song was just amazing!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.630
I'm sorry.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:25.080
A long time ago I used to be able to dance and groove to a beat,

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.280
but now I've found that I rarely listen to music anymore.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.040
I see...

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.290
I'm really sorry though.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.170
Don't mind it.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.830
Now then, time to g—

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.670
Oh my.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.050
If it isn't urgent, we can deliver these to your home later today.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.550
That's too much to ask for...

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.230
All this together must be really heavy.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.750
We'll make some time this evening.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.430
I'll bring them for you!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.910
Look at all the fans here!

00:04:57.910 --> 00:04:59.840
I'm happy that so many people came.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:00.870
Yeah.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.660
Ichigo, you look like you're having fun.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.490
Of course I am! What could be better than doing idol activities with your two best friends?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.370
Nothing! {...}

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.410
That's right!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.240
We will now begin Soleil's handshake event!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.200
Bye bye.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.570
I was just chosen to be the captain of my soccer club.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:23.760
Ichigo-san, you're the leader of Soleil, right?

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:28.180
Right, although I feel like Aoi and Ran are always helping me out of sticky situations.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.800
I'll do my best as captain!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.030
Please do the same, Ichigo-san!

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.170
Thanks, I will!

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.600
Good job, Soleil!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.150
The handshake event was a great success, yeah!

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:46.070
That event was announced via KiraKiratter and television, was it not?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.660
Yes, they're just like Tristar.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.310
Soleil's name is spreading across the world like wildfire!

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:57.210
Bepp-sensei, do you know the saying

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.080
about how lionesses throw their children from cliffs in order to strengthen them?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.350
Yes?

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.210
Is that another way of saying "spare the rod and spoil the child"?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:07.500
Correct. In order to raise those girls to be strong idols,

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.140
we must occasionally become lions ourselves!

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.890
L-Lions?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.390
Isn't this close to where your house is, Ichigo?

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:24.230
Yep! I used to come here all the time with my family.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.400
Johnny-sensei, what was it you wanted to tell us?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.090
I know that you only just got out of your handshake event, but I've come with your next mission.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.490
Good job at the handshake event.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.490
Headmistress!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:40.370
I know it's sudden, but you're going to be holding a concert tonight.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:42.780
Tonight?

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:43.790
Where?

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.390
The open-air stage in front of you.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.510
Your job is to fill every single seat.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.470
But if there's even a single seat that is unfilled,

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.010
the concert is off.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:07:00.130
If you manage to hold the concert, I'll have a wonderful summer present waiting.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.480
What kind of present is it?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.780
I'll leave that to your imagination.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:09.530
First, you must focus on making this concert a success by yourselves.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.070
I wish you luck.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.700
I wonder what she means by wonderful summer?

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.790
It's just like our headmistress to give us this kind of trial without warning.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.920
Let's start by posting something on KiraKiratter.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.630
Stop right there, Kiriya-honey.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.750
KiraKiratter, the web, and TV.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.840
The Academy Mother has decided that you aren't allowed to use a single one of these today. {what?}

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.870
So that's what this is...

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:32.970
That's what what is?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.260
She wants us to advertise on our own two legs.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:36.850
Legs?

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:42.020
It's a simple matter to get the word out using the internet or mass media.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:45.620
With those out of the picture, we'll have to rely on ourselves

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:48.730
to fill every seat here with our fans.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.150
Rely on ourselves...

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:56.260
Aoi, Ran! I'll do everything I can as our leader!

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.690
Good work, Bepp-sensei.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:03.750
Headmistress.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:07.810
Don't you think this mission is too hard for our Soleil-honeys?

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:09.510
The bar is too high.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.310
I believe I told you before.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:17.260
I want to make those girls into idols who can pave their own road towards their dreams.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:24.020
It's true that Soleil is currently able to bring together a large group of fans by using the internet or TV.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:28.590
In this day and age, that is a very useful skill.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:33.090
However, in order to allow those girls to reach even greater heights,

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.940
we must teach them how to run with their own two legs until they're dripping with sweat. {intentionally keeping sweat here}

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.540
Is this what you meant with your lioness metaphor?

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.420
Just try and get up here, you little girls! {I don't know how to make this stronger but still appropriate}

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.040
Worry not.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.430
Those girls will surely be able to overcome this.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:56.060
Everyone, good afternoon! {I kind of want to object, but ...}

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:57.390
We're Soleil!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.200
Please come to our concert tonight!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.210
It starts at sunset!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.230
We're holding it on this very stage!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.980
We're counting on you!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.150
There's not much of a reaction...

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.460
Everyone at the handshake event before was so excited to see us...

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.490
I wonder why?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.050
The people who came to our event were already Soleil fans,

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.410
but most of the people here haven't even heard of us.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:26.190
That's probably why. Adults and the elderly don't really know that much about idols.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.500
I know!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.430
Aoi, Ran!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.030
Follow your leader! {the?}

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:31.560
Wait up!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.880
Ichigo, where are you going?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.710
Powa...

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:45.680
Powa...

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.130
Puririn...

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.270
Love you!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.650
It's perfect!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.060
Is this really necessary?

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:55.690
Very much! Our introduction is the most important part of our unit!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:59.100
This kind of stuff suits you two so you're okay with it,

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:02.080
but this cutesy stuff doesn't fit my character.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:06.060
Shion-sama plays a very cool character in "Naughty Detective".

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:09.480
You have quite a hard-boiled image about you.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.590
Shion-chan can "love you" too!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.590
Can I really?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:17.470
As an actress, you have up to seven different faces. {expressions?} {it's fine}

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.930
Seven faces?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:19.780
Yeah!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:23.150
That's right! In drama, you act as the cool Shion-sama.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:27.350
In this unit, a heretofore unseen cute Shion-sama may appear! {good use of "heretofore"}

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.320
There's actually this part that I've been interested in.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:34.440
But I didn't audition because I thought it didn't suit me...

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.290
You have to try!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:39.990
I shall support you with all my soul!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.450
I'll go for it!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.300
Once more from the top.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:44.960
Powa...

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:45.870
Powa...

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:46.870
Puririn!

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.960
Aikatsu! Soleil!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.430
I figured we'd be running soon.

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:54.920
Ichigo <i>is</i> our leader.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.130
We're holding a concert here tonight!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.720
Ah, it's Soleil!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:10:59.380
Soleil!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:00.980
Soleil!

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.420
A concert!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:06.020
Let's do everything we can so that even one more person knows about us.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.630
This way they may even come to our concert.

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:10.800
You're right. This is the best option.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.970
Okay, I'm behind you, leader!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:13.650
Me too!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.770
Great! Next up is...

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.070
Hello everyone!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.950
We're Soleil!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.270
Wow, it's Soleil.

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:25.490
They're so cute!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:26.630
Who're they?

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:28.680
Dad, you haven't heard of them?

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.650
We're Soleil!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.250
Uh, okay, Soleil...

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:36.130
Please lend us your power so that we can make this concert a success!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.990
Please turn me into a strawberry!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:39.760
Sure.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:42.380
You're not running for office.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.890
Onee-chan!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.100
Ah, Raichi!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.280
Looks like we forgot to eat lunch somewhere along the way.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.190
Are you really fine with just rice balls?

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.290
Yep, we don't have much time anyway.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.660
Sorry for dropping in on you like this.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.030
You're always welcome in our home.

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:08.490
They're delicious.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.800
They really are.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.400
Um, Aoi-neesan, Ran-san...

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:15.100
Is my sister doing a good job as leader?

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:15.670
You bet.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.540
Really?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.750
Raichi, who do you think I am?

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.680
Ichigo is the only one capable of leading Soleil.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:28.040
Soleil will become an idol unit that shines as brightly as a strawberry parfait.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:31.310
So long as Ichigo is always herself, Soleil will be just fine.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:31.890
Yeah.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:34.280
Aoi, Ran...

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:39.020
Ever since Soleil was formed, I've felt like I could always give my all!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:42.120
And that's all thanks to Aoi and Ran being there for me.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.850
Units are the best.

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:45.910
Embarrassing remarks aren't allowed. {hazukashii serifu kinshi!}

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.700
I want to hold this concert with you two. {Ehh~}

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.330
Let's get as many fans to see us as we can!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.540
It's wonderful that you'll be having a concert there.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:58.670
When Ichigo was younger, she used to sing for us on that open-air stage.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.500
Mama sung there as a kid too.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.170
I did.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:06.030
If it's such an important place, we've got no choice but to hold our concert.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:06.300
Yep.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.310
Mama, what's that?

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.660
Oh, we're going to bring that over to one of our customers later.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.060
I tried to tell that old lady all about Soleil when she was over here.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.570
But then she said she doesn't really listen to music anymore...

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.230
Mama, can I go along with Raichi?

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.080
Yes?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.450
Good afternoon.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:33.790
You're the boy from the bento shop.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.300
Here you are.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.540
Thank you.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.210
This is my big sister, along with Aoi-neesan and Ran-san.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.570
Good afternoon. We're Soleil.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:45.770
Oh, you're that singing group.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:49.480
Yes! If you have the time, please come to our concert tonight.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:50.300
But...

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.640
Please listen to our song.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.710
Soleil means "sun". {???}

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:03.730
We chose that name because we want to shine as brightly as the sun and fill everyone with happiness.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:06.240
Perhaps I will go.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.200
Oh yes, do you mind if I bring a few of my friends?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.160
Not at all!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.750
Wow, there are so many people here.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.190
Think you could spare a minute and come to my company?

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.390
Now that's a delicious strawberry.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.330
I'm Ichigo! Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.760
I'm Kiriya Aoi.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:31.890
Shibuki Ran.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.900
We're Soleil!

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.520
Are you the one from "Naughty Detective"?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.430
That's right.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.070
Whoa, my friends would flip if they heard about this!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.150
Your friends?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:41.970
Good work today.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:45.120
A-Are you really Kiriya Aoi-san from "Naughty Detective"?

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:45.650
Yes.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:49.700
The Naughty Detective!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.990
In the flesh!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.730
Love you!

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.600
Love you...

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.510
What's going on?

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.650
Soleil's holding a concert!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.630
That looks so exciting!

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.230
It appears that Soleil is having a concert.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.940
We have to keep an eye on PowaPuri's rival group.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.030
Sure.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.900
Unfortunately, you have yet to fill every seat.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.160
What?

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.300
If even a single seat remained unfilled,

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.060
the headmistress said the concert would be off.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.250
You almost made it.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.820
No... we tried so hard...

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.890
Johnny-sensei, please let us hold the concert!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.770
But, Hoshimiya...

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:05.380
I know we weren't able to fill every seat here.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:08.070
But we can't let down the fans who came to see us!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.930
Soleil must always shine with the greatest radiance.

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:16.070
I won't let us disappoint a single one of our fans!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.380
Ichigo...

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.040
Please, Sensei. {We beg you}

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.460
Allow us to hold the concert!

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:26.960
Okay, let's begin the live.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.590
Sensei!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.300
I'll talk to the headmistress for you later.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.080
Go, Soleil-honeys!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.970
Thank you very much!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.760
Aoi, Ran!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.930
Let's shine as brightly as the sun! {I have no idea what to do for this}

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.220
Triangle Sunny Light!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.650
That was great, honeys!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.410
Truly a wonderful concert.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.410
Yeah!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.700
Headmistress!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.140
Although they didn't fill every seat in the house,

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.880
they begged me to let them hold the concert.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:56.340
What are you talking about, Bepp-sensei?

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:00.370
I said, it was your idea in the first place that if they couldn't get enough fans,

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.330
the concert would be canceled...

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.460
Take a look.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.710
Soleil!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:10.140
Forget about a full house, this place is overflowing with people who can't even find a place to sit.

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:13.690
Because those girls shined like the sun itself,

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.700
fans were naturally drawn to them.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.900
Galaxy amazing!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.390
Wonderful, Soleil-honeys!

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.510
They climbed back up the cliff with their own two legs.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.940
Soleil's wonderfully passionate concert

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:30.150
filled my heart to the brim.

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:32.170
You've got a good unit there.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:34.540
You'll be a worthy rival for Powa Powa Puririn!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.040
Thanks!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.020
Onee-chan!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.040
Amazing, that was a great concert.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.930
Thank you very much.

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:46.180
It's been so many years since I've danced like that.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.810
My body moved on its own as I listened to your song.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.970
Soleil... the sun.

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:56.190
It's a perfect name for the three of you.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:57.190
Thanks!

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.710
I'd love to hear you perform again.

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.880
Perhaps even sometime this summer...

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.190
Oh, well...

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.750
We still haven't decided our summer plans yet.

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:07.650
I see.

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.580
I'll let you know if I hear anything.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:13.330
I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.810
Enter.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.120
Please excuse us.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.180
Good work today.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.480
For giving us this opportunity...

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:29.930
Thank you very much. {ehh} {it's... kind of fine}

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.200
You exceeded my expectations.

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.680
All of you did a great job.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.640
As promised, I now give you a wonderful summer present.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.250
Wow, what could it be?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.350
Maybe an ice cream cone every day?

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:43.090
Really?

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:45.890
Or maybe we won't have any summer homework?

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:47.200
I wouldn't say no to that.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.580
Come in.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.080
Excuse me. {I think this is finer}

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.290
Mizuki-san!

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.200
Tristar!

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.740
Hi, Soleil girls!

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:57.960
Good evening.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.290
Why...

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:04.360
This summer, Tristar and Soleil will join forces and hold a Summer Tour.

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:07.990
Let the new unit, STAR☆ANIS, be born!

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:09.760
STAR☆ANIS...

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.320
Now, rise!

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:14.770
Rise to ever greater heights, idols!

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:16.140
Looking forward to it.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.620
A Summer Tour with Mizuki-san?

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:19.590
No way.

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:22.410
This summer isn't gonna be calm! {oh... fine}

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.660
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:03.350
There's an aphorism that says lions throw their young over a cliff to test them.

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:05.470
Though I heard it doesn't actually happen.

00:24:05.470 --> 00:24:07.300
Climbing cliffs is my specialty!

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:09.760
Spare the rod and spoil the child. {...}

00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:13.680
Sun, sun, sun, shining bright in the sky!

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:14.400
A midsummer...

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:15.570
That song!

00:24:15.570 --> 00:24:16.550
Do you remember?

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:18.410
Yeah, I'd never forget!

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:19.910
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.910 --> 00:24:21.370
Girl meets girl.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:25.920
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
